<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ca">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>{{ purpose.emailSubject }}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #FAF6F0; font-family: 'Raleway', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1D2F4B;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background-color: #FAF6F0; padding: 30px 15px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" style="max-width: 600px; background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(202, 163, 108, 0.4); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(29, 47, 75, 0.08);">
          <tr>
            <td style="height: 6px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1D2F4B 0%, #CAA36C 50%, #1D2F4B 100%);"></td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 30px 40px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(106, 134, 162, 0.15);">
              <h1 style="font-family: 'Marcellus', Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; color: #1D2F4B; margin: 0 0 5px; letter-spacing: 1px;">REGISTRALS</h1>
              <p style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #CAA36C; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">Seguretat i Custòdia Digital</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 35px 40px;">
              <h2 style="font-family: 'Marcellus', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; color: #1D2F4B; margin: 0 0 15px;">
                {{ purpose.emailHeading }}
              </h2>
              <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1D2F4B; margin: 0 0 14px;">
                Hola {{ user.firstName }},
              </p>
              <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1D2F4B; margin: 0 0 24px;">
                {{ purpose.emailIntro|raw }}
              </p>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="background-color: #FAF6F0; border: 1.5px solid #CAA36C; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px 24px;">
                    <span style="display: block; font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #6A86A2; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 6px;">Codi de Verificació</span>
                    <span style="font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #1D2F4B; display: inline-block;">{{ code }}</span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <div style="border-left: 3.5px solid #CAA36C; background-color: rgba(202, 163, 108, 0.10); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 12px; color: #1D2F4B; line-height: 1.5;">
                <strong>Validesa i seguretat:</strong> Aquest codi d'un sol ús caducarà automàticament en <strong>{{ expiresInMinutes }} minuts</strong> (màxim 5 intents). No el comparteixis amb ningú; el nostre equip mai te'l demanarà.
              </div>

              <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6A86A2; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
                Si no has iniciat aquesta operació, ignora aquest correu electrònic i, si tenies un compte actiu, et recomanem revisar la teva contrasenya al perfil.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 18px 40px; background-color: #FAF6F0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(106, 134, 162, 0.15); text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: #6A86A2;">
              &copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Registrals &middot; Aquest és un correu de seguretat automatitzat.
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>

